#: scenario4:scenario4_155414E4_7BC2_42C3_ADAC_03AE430B1530
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c8e414522233108338672ab2b914514d5a392a993d587766d211d8d484c1dbc
